      "source": [
        "# 🎯 SemiShape QLoRA Fine-tuning Notebook\n",
        "\n",
        "**Model**: IBM Granite 4.0 H Micro\n",
        "**Library**: Unsloth (optimalizované pro Google Colab)\n",
        "**Dataset**: build123d bilinguální (cs/en)\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "## 📋 Požadavky\n",
        "- Google Colab **T4 GPU** nebo lepší (A100 ideální)\n",
        "- ~2-4 hodiny tréninku\n",
        "- Dataset nahraný na HuggingFace Hub nebo Google Drive\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": ["## 1️⃣ Instalace závislostí"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "%%capture\n",
        "import os\n",
        "if 'COLAB_' in os.environ:\n",
        "    !pip install --no-deps bitsandbytes accelerate xformers==0.0.29 peft transformers==4.45.2 trl==0.11.1\n",
        "    !pip install --no-deps torch==2.4.1 --index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu124\n",
        "    !pip install \"unsloth[colab-new] @ git+https://github.com/unslothai/unsloth.git\"\n",
        "else:\n",
        "    !pip install unsloth\n",
        "!pip install --no-deps flash-attn==2.6.3 --no-build-isolation 2>/dev/null || echo 'flash-attn optional'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": ["## 2️⃣ Načtení modelu (Granite 4.0 H Micro)"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "from unsloth import FastLanguageModel\n",
        "import torch\n",
        "\n",
        "max_seq_length = 2048\n",
        "dtype = None\n",
        "load_in_4bit = True\n",
        "\n",
        "model, tokenizer = FastLanguageModel.from_pretrained(\n",
        "    model_name = 'ibm-granite/granite-4.0-h-micro',\n",
        "    max_seq_length = max_seq_length,\n",
        "    dtype = dtype,\n",
        "    load_in_4bit = load_in_4bit,\n",
        ")\n",
        "print(f'Model loaded: {max_seq_length} context length')"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": ["## 3️⃣ Konfigurace LoRA adapterů"]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "model = FastLanguageModel.get_peft_model(\n",
        "    model,\n",
        "    r = 16,\n",
        "    target_modules = ['q_proj', 'k_proj', 'v_proj', 'o_proj',\n",
        "                      'gate_proj', 'up_proj', 'down_proj'],\n",
        "    lora_alpha = 32,\n",
        "    lora_dropout = 0.05,\n",
        "    bias = 'none',\n",
        "    use_gradient_checkpointing = 'unsloth',\n",
        "    random_state = 42,\n",
        "    use_rslora = True,\n",
        "    loftq_config = None,\n",
        ")\n",
        "print('LoRA adapters configured!')"
      ]
    },
    {
